  "priorExpiration": "1999-05-18",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ch 104.01 Office Location, Telephone Number, Number for TTY/TDD Users, and Mailing Address.\n\n(a) The board's office is located at the office of professional licensure and certification (OPLC), 7 Eagle Square, Concord, New Hampshire.\n\n(b) The OPLC main telephone number is (603) 271-2152.\n\n(c) In-state TTY/TDD users may reach the office by calling Relay New Hampshire at 711 or 1 (800) 735-2964.\n\n(d) Requests for information, including board records, shall be made in accordance with Plc 103.\n\n(e) Requests for information, written submissions to the board, and other correspondence shall be addressed as follows:\n\nOffice of Professional Licensure and Certification\n\nBoard of Chiropractic Examiners\n\n7 Eagle Square\n\nConcord, New Hampshire 03301-2412\n\nSource. #5624, eff 5-18-93, EXPIRED: 5-18-99\n\nNew. #7516, eff 6-27-01; ss by #14207, eff 3-7-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ch100-500.html"
